:: b5 [b5 pretty-rock-bay map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around.->b5: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Admire the water.->b5: the sea]]</li>
      <li>[[Investigate the sand castle.->crabby critters]]</li>
      <li>[[Talk to the trainer.->dontay]]</li>
      <li>[[Talk to the person near the tide pools.->lani]]</li>
      <li>[[That lighthouse looks interesting.->404]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'b5'>><<n>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'b5'>>
</div>

:: b5: description [b5 pretty-rock-bay description]
<p>A serene beach stretches out before you. The white sand feels warm to the touch. The ocean waves crash against the shore.</p>
<p>Someone seems to have built a sandcastle. You can see movement nearby.</p>
<p>A Mergimal trainer is near the south end of the beach. You watch them skillfully cast their fishing line into the clear water.</p>
<p>There is a young person near the tide pools, carefully observing the Mergimals that live there.</p>
<p>A large, imposing lighthouse stands on a small island just off the coast.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: b5: the sea [b5 pretty-rock-bay sea]
<p>The water is cool and inviting. You look out over the sea. You can see a boat off in the distance. This might be a good fishing spot.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Go fishing. (requires keyword: ROD)'>>
      <<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('rusty')>>
        <<dialog 'no rod'>>
          <<include 'no rod'>>
        <</dialog>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'b5: fishing'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[See what else is around here: continue exploring the bay.->b5]]</li>
</ul>


:: crabby critters [b5 pretty-rock-bay worksheet]
<<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('rusty')>>
  <p>A group of crab-like Mergimals seems to be protecting a large sand castle. An old fishing pole sticks out of the center tower, holding a flag.</p>
  <p>Maybe you can figure out some way to avoid the creatures and grab it?</p>
  <p>Do Worksheet 'Crabby Critters'.</p>
  <p>Enter the code:  <<numberbox '_$code' 0>></p>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li>
      <<link 'See if you got past them.'>>
        <<if _$code != 141>>
          <<dialog 'incorrect'>>
            <<include 'incorrect'>>
          <</dialog>>
        <<else>>
          <<dialog 'correct'>>
            <<include 'correct'>>
            <<onclose>>
              <<goto 'rusty rod reward'>>
          <</dialog>>
        <</if>>
      <</link>>
    </li>
    <li>[[Leave them alone for now and continue exploring.->b5]]</li>
  </ul>
<<else>>
  <p>(Keyword RUSTY detected)</p>
  <p>There are some Krustwos here, protecting a sad sand castle. You'd better stay away.</p>
  <ul class='choices'>
    <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
  </ul>
<</if>>

:: rusty rod reward [b5 pretty-rock-bay reward]
<p>After a short while, you seem to find a pattern in the crabs' movements. You wait for an opening and dash to the castle, attempting to grab the fishing rod.</p>
<p>
  Gain keyword RUSTY.
  <<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.push('rusty')>>
  <<redo 'keywords'>>
</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]</li>
</ul>

:: b5: fishing [b5 pretty-rock-bay fishing stray]

You cast your rod into the clear, blue water. After only a short while, you feel something pulling your line.

Test two cards.

You got...

<<link '...zero correct.' 'stray encounter'>>
    <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition].common]>>
<</link>>
<<link '...one correct.' 'stray encounter'>>
    <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition].uncommon]>>
<</link>>
<<link '...two correct.' 'stray encounter'>>
    <<set $mergimalEncountered = $mergimals[$encounterTable[$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition].rare]>>
<</link>>
[[Continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]

:: 131 [worksheet secret]
You found a bottle floating in the water. It has a message inside! You unroll it and find a strange script.

Do Worksheet 'Message in a Botttle'.

[[Decode the message later: continue exploring.->$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition]]

:: b5: paddling to sea [swim]
<p>(Keyword PADDLE detected)</p>
<p>You ride your Mergimal out to sea. The water is calm at first, but gets rougher as you go.</p>
<p>Skip count by d12, d12 times.</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Success: you made it!->b3]]</li>
  <li>[[Failure: gain an injury.->b3]]</li>
</ul>

:: b5: strained line [encounter]
You reel your line in and it nearly snaps.

<strong>Test</strong> GRIT x 7.

[[Failure: Gain TIRED.->stray: corwhal]]
[[Success: +2 to TAME.->stray: corwhal]]

:: lani [b5 pretty-rock-bay lani]
<p>On your next step forward, you feel your foot hit water.</p>
<p>“Oh hey — don’t step there, that’s my research site…”</p>
<p>A young person in a white lab coat stands amongst the tide pools, holding a tape recorder.</p>
<p>“Well, it’s technically a puddle, but it’s very important data.</p>
<p>You live here in the village, right? I’ve seen you around. I’m Lani, I just moved here from Little Moose to study with Professor Tamarack.</p>
<p>I was hoping the professor would teach me to ride a mergimal out to sea, but he said he was, um, like, super duper busy and stuff.</p>
<p>If you figure out how to get out there, I'll watch your technique!</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>[[Ask about the recorder.->lani: recorder]]</li>
  <li>
    <<link 'Ride your Mergimal out to sea (requires: keyword PADDLE)'>>
      <<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('paddle')>>
        <<dialog 'no keyword paddle'>>
          <<include 'no paddle'>>
        <</dialog>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'b5: paddling to sea'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Keep exploring the beach.->b5]]</li>
</ul>

:: lani: recorder [b5 pretty-rock-bay lani recorder]
<p>“Oh, this? It’s a waterproof tape recorder. I’m recording my observations.</p>
<p>Ever since I was a kid, words on a page never really looked right to me. And writing them is even trickier.</p>
<p>But it hasn’t stopped me. I take all the notes I need on this thing...and it’s waterproof!</p>
<ul class='choices'>
  <li>
    <<link 'Ride your Mergimal out to sea (requires: keyword PADDLE)'>>
      <<if !$players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].keywords.includes('paddle')>>
        <<dialog 'no keyword paddle'>>
          <<include 'no paddle'>>
        <</dialog>>
      <<else>>
        <<goto 'b5: paddling to sea'>>
      <</if>>
    <</link>>
  </li>
  <li>[[Keep exploring the beach.->b5]]</li>
</ul>